          "isEvent": false,
          "hasDeadline": false,
          "intendedDay": "+1d"
        }
      ]
    },
    "note": "Roman's guard against the template firing on real work: a task with a day, a fuzzy time and a duration adjustment must be captured and answered by the model, never the premade line. 'Afternoon' carries no clock time, so no placement is asserted."
